    "turn_text": "Yeah, and I really appreciated your emphasis on competitive sports. Again, this is something that when you're talking to sort of more hardcore academics and professors, sometimes really bothers them that there's such an emphasis on sport and competition in this country, especially in higher education. I mean, I was also an athlete, so it really resonated with me talking about how much that helped you. What do you think are some of the lessons that you took from that to the leadership roles that you had later on in the military and in business?",
