        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "Past inaction on debt issues implies that current concerns may also lack urgency or consequence.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Economic collapse would likely result if the U.S. fails to address its debt obligations to China.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views themselves as capable of assessing macroeconomic risks based on personal memory and experience.",
