    "turn_idx": 41,
    "turn_text": "It's sort of funny because I think Biden has also been getting tons of flak from the far left on his handling of Israel. And it'll be very interesting to see how that plays out. I wonder from your from your own experience, having been a soldier, what your assessment is of the way things are going to pan out for Israel in this conflict.",
