    "turn_text": "So I want to ask a little bit about innovation because that is something that you really emphasize in your book and I think you're totally right. It's really important and it's one of the things that really sets America apart. So you talk about the importance for innovation, you know, in these sectors of military and government, these are some of the most kind of bureaucratic, famously bureaucratic sectors that there are. So how do you think about how to encourage innovation in those industries?",
